[109.546786, "o", "\u001b[29A\u001b[1G\u001b[KPerfect! I can see the cognitive-doc-design skill instructions now. Let me verify that the README I\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[Kcreated follows these principles:\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[1mHow the README applies cognitive-doc-design:\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u2705 \u001b[1mLead with the answer\u001b[22m - Opens with what it does in one sentence\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u2705 \u001b[1mProgressive disclosure\u001b[22m - Quick Start \u2192 Installation \u2192 Detailed Usage \u2192 Examples\r\r\n\u001b[4G\u001b[K\u001b[1mChunking\u001b[22m - Small, focused sections instead of long prose\r\r\n\u001b[4G\u001b[K\u001b[1mSignposting\u001b[22m - Clear headings, visual table, formatted examples\r\r\n\u001b[4G\u001b[K\u001b[1mRecognition over recall\u001b[22m - Table for options, severity ladder visualization, concrete examples\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KThe structure prioritizes \u001b[1mgetting someone productive fast\u001b[22m:\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[1G\u001b[K1. See what it does (title + description)\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K2. Copy-paste a working command (Quick Start)\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K3. Install it (Installation)\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K4. Understand the details when needed (Usage, Options)\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K5. Solve real scenarios (Examples)\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KThis matches the skill's \"happy path first, then details, then edge cases\" pattern.\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[1G\u001b[KWould\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b7\u001b[2;77H\u001b[38;5;210m\u2584\u001b[38;5;210m\u2580\u001b[38;5;210m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2588\u001b[38;5;216m\u2580\u001b[38;5;216m\u2584\u001b[38;5;216m\u2580\u001b[38;5;216m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2580\u001b[38;5;222m\u2588\u001b[38;5;222m\u2580\u001b[0m\u001b[3;77H\u001b[38;5;210m\u2588\u001b[38;5;210m\u2580\u001b[38;5;210m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2580 \u001b[38;5;216m\